    title: "History Globe dataset"
    authors:
      - family-names: Arnaut
        given-names: Vadym
    url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/ArVaViT/history-globe"
    license: CC-BY-4.0
    notes: >-
      The data of https://historyglobe.app/api/v1/, rebuilt with each release;
      the articles and the answered questions are not in it. CC BY 4.0 covers
      this data only, not the articles, the questions or the code.
